{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"65d7ae77-46cc-4bb2-b615-86e08be69236","status":"SUCCESS","response":"# Wayfinder Read-and-Plan Execution Summary (`20261013T225035-656-0beg`)\n\n## 1. Functionality Understanding Check\n\nPer [`functional_specification_013.md`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T225035-656-0beg/functional_specification_013.md) and [`LANGUAGE.md`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T225035-656-0beg/LANGUAGE.md), the objective is to replace hardcoded pipeline fixtures, bypassed handoff contracts, and false 1:1 cross-agency foreign-key assumptions in [`src/graph/`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T225035-656-0beg/src/graph/__init__.py) with a deterministic, autonomous **8-Hop Cross-Agency Policy Traversal \u0026 Linkage Pipeline**:\n\n1. **Hop 0 (Policy Keyword $\\to$ Legislative Initiative — Search/Discovery Hop):** Query Congress.gov (`GET /v3/bill?query={Policy Keyword}\u0026sort=relevancy`) to resolve the highest-relevance advocacy bill (`BILL-117-hr-3630` for `\"LTA\"`), failing fast with [`LegislativeResolutionError`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T225035-656-0beg/wayfinder/20261013T225035-656-0beg/tickets/ticket-001.md) on empty or invalid queries.\n2. **Hop 1 (Legislative Initiative $\\to$ Enacted Public Law — Hybrid Direct/Discovery Hop):** Inspect `bill.laws`; when empty (omnibus incorporation), traverse `/relatedbills` to identify the enacting omnibus vehicle (`BILL-117-hr-2617`, *Consolidated Appropriations Act, 2023*) and extract `PLAW-117-328` (`2022-12-29`), emitting linear edges `BILL-117-hr-3630 -[:INCORPORATED_INTO]-\u003e BILL-117-hr-2617 -[:ENACTED_AS]-\u003e PLAW-117-328` and returning [`LegislativeHandoff`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T225035-656-0beg/wayfinder/20261013T225035-656-0beg/tickets/ticket-002.md) (or raising `EnactedLawNotFoundError`).\n3. **Hop 2 (Public Law $\\to$ Statutory Section \u0026 U.S. Code Codification — Direct Linkage + Structural Traversal):** Dynamically derive the GovInfo USLM package (`PLAW-117publ328`) from `LegislativeHandoff.public_law_id`, structurally match `\u003csection identifier=\"/us/pl/117/328/dFF/tIV/stD/s4133\"\u003e` (`Section 4133`), extract all 5 amended U.S. Code citations (`42 U.S.C. 1395x(s)(2)(JJ)`, `42 U.S.C. 1395x(mmm)`, `42 U.S.C. 1395l(a)(1)(GG)`, `42 U.S.C. 1395m(z)`, `42 U.S.C. 1395w-3(a)(2)(D)`) and `effective_date=\"2024-01-01\"`, returning [`StatutoryHandoff`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T225035-656-0beg/wayfinder/20261013T225035-656-0beg/tickets/ticket-003.md) (or raising `StatutorySectionNotFoundError`).\n4. **Hop 3 (Statutory Section $\\to$ Implementing Final Rule — Search/Discovery Hop):** Query the Federal Register API (`conditions[type][]=RULE`, `conditions[agencies][]=centers-for-medicare-medicaid-services`) using the statutory section and USC citations to resolve Final Rule `2023-24455` (`88 FR 77676`, Docket `CMS-1780-F`, RIN `0938-AV03`, `42 CFR Part 410, 414, 424, 484`), returning [`RegulatoryHandoff`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T225035-656-0beg/wayfinder/20261013T225035-656-0beg/tickets/ticket-004.md) (or raising `RegulatoryRuleResolutionError`).\n5. **Hop 4 (Final Rule $\\to$ Operational Change Request \u0026 Transmittal — Search/Discovery Hop):** Resolve CMS Change Request `13286` (Pub. `100-04`) and its supersession chain—active Transmittal `R12471CP` superseding `R12379CP` (replacing the inaccurate hardcoded `\"12349\"`), Benefit Category `LC`, and Pricing Indicator `40`—returning [`OperationalHandoff`](file:///Users/diesel/Desktop/LAG/.sandcastle/worktrees/agent-plan-20261013T225035-656-0beg/wayfinder/20261013T225035-656-0beg/tickets/ticket-004.md) (or raising `OperationalDirectiveMissingError`).\n6. **Hop 5